des Hamburgi&#x017F;chen                             unpartheyi&#x017F;chen Corre&#x017F;pondenten.</hi><lb/>
</titlePart>                 </docTitle>                 <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>                 <lb/>
<docDate><hi rendition="#aq">Anno</hi> 1813. <hi rendition="#c">(Am Mittewochen, den                     3 November.)</hi></docDate>                 <docTitle>                     <titlePart type="sub"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#right">No.</hi>                         176.</hi></titlePart>                 </docTitle>                 <lb/>
